{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dwarf_gunner","model_identifier":"dwarf_gunner","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# dwarf_gunner\n\nDwarf gunner (A4), ranged, cities only, 1.3 m = 46 u (cap to 47).\n\nDwarf in a deep-red wool coat with tails, leather bandolier with brass charges across the chest, charcoal trousers, heavy boots and a brimmed leather cap; a long dwarf musket (1.5 m, brass-banded barrel, brass lock, ramrod under the barrel), a powder horn at the left hip and a charge pouch on the belt. Slow reload.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..47.0, z -6.0..5.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 22 x 47 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `fire` | 1.6 | once | key 0.75 s: shot fires (muzzle flash/smoke at the muzzle, 43 u along -Z from the grip); recoil 0.85 s |\n| `reload` | 5 | once | 5.0 s: butt grounded, pour powder (1.0-1.9 s), ram (2.3-4.0 s); key 4.5 s: reloaded, back to rest by 5.0 s |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | musket on the right shoulder (also walk and run) |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.56 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 0.8 s\n- `run`: 92.4 u/s (2.60 m/s), cycle 0.56 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `fire`: key 0.75 s: shot fires (muzzle flash/smoke at the muzzle, 43 u along -Z from the grip); recoil 0.85 s\n- `reload`: 5.0 s: butt grounded, pour powder (1.0-1.9 s), ram (2.3-4.0 s); key 4.5 s: reloaded, back to rest by 5.0 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `musket` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 53 u, grip at the origin (wrist of the stock), butt 10 u back, muzzle 43 u forward; `fx` point = muzzle\n- `powder_horn` (visible, under slot_hip_l)\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- musket (fire): second grip (left hand) 14 u along the barrel forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_gunner_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_gunner_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_gunner_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_gunner_grey.png`: grey beard\n\n## Notes\n\n- In reload the musket stays in the right hand with its butt on the ground; the left hand does the pouring and ramming (the ramrod cube stays on the gun).\n"},"description":"# dwarf_gunner\n\nDwarf gunner (A4), ranged, cities only, 1.3 m = 46 u (cap to 47).\n\nDwarf in a deep-red wool coat with tails, leather bandolier with brass charges across the chest, charcoal trousers, heavy boots and a brimmed leather cap; a long dwarf musket (1.5 m, brass-banded barrel, brass lock, ramrod under the barrel), a powder horn at the left hip and a charge pouch on the belt. Slow reload.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..47.0, z -6.0..5.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 22 x 47 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `fire` | 1.6 | once | key 0.75 s: shot fires (muzzle flash/smoke at the muzzle, 43 u along -Z from the grip); recoil 0.85 s |\n| `reload` | 5 | once | 5.0 s: butt grounded, pour powder (1.0-1.9 s), ram (2.3-4.0 s); key 4.5 s: reloaded, back to rest by 5.0 s |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | musket on the right shoulder (also walk and run) |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.56 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 0.8 s\n- `run`: 92.4 u/s (2.60 m/s), cycle 0.56 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `fire`: key 0.75 s: shot fires (muzzle flash/smoke at the muzzle, 43 u along -Z from the grip); recoil 0.85 s\n- `reload`: 5.0 s: butt grounded, pour powder (1.0-1.9 s), ram (2.3-4.0 s); key 4.5 s: reloaded, back to rest by 5.0 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `musket` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 53 u, grip at the origin (wrist of the stock), butt 10 u back, muzzle 43 u forward; `fx` point = muzzle\n- `powder_horn` (visible, under slot_hip_l)\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- musket (fire): second grip (left hand) 14 u along the barrel forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_gunner_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_gunner_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_gunner_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_gunner_grey.png`: grey beard\n\n## Notes\n\n- In reload the musket stays in the right hand with its butt on the ground; the left hand does the pouring and ramming (the ramrod cube stays on the gun).\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,21.0,-4.5],"to":[7.0,24.0,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,21.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[114,73,128.0,76.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[14,77,23.0,80.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,77,14.0,80.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[23,77,32.0,80.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[48,40,62.0,49.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[62,40,76.0,49.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ed00d7b2-b11e-5d62-81bb-6785d826e246"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,24.0,-5.0],"to":[8.0,36.0,5.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,24.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[10,0,26.0,12.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[42,0,52.0,12.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[26,0,42.0,12.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[52,0,62.0,12.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[96,0,112.0,10.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[112,0,128.0,10.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"795d6011-045a-5e8d-92ca-f29926aa2c36"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.5,36.0,-2.5],"to":[2.5,37.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,36.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[20,84,25.0,85.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[25,84,30.0,85.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[30,84,35.0,85.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[35,84,40.0,85.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[10,67,15.0,72.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[15,67,20.0,72.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"fc192c04-8a71-511f-91de-86068191836f"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror